722,finger-tracking,"You have a left and right human hand in front for you.  The palms are face down and the fingers are pointed away from you.  The right hand is to the right of the left hand, the thumbs are in the middle.  You will answer the following questions about a ring moving between fingers using this scenario.  The ring can move from one hand to the other by passing from one thumb to the other. Your answer will be two words based on which hand and finger the ring is on. The first word will be ""Left"" or ""Right"", denoting the hand the ring is on; the second will be the one-word name of the finger the ring is on. For example, [Left Pinky]. Provide your reasoning first, and then put this final answer between brackets [].

