1069,logic,"Inhabitants of an island lie consistently on Tuesdays, Thursdays, and Saturdays, and they tell the truth on the other four days of the week. You have forgotten what day of the week it is, so you ask a passerby. 'Saturday,' he answers. 'And what day will it be tomorrow?' you inquire. 'Wednesday,' he replies. Can you tell what day it is today?

",7,"Based on answer 1, today cannot be M, W, F, Su, or Sa (lying day). Based on answer 2, today cannot be M, W, F, Su, or Tu (lying day). So, today must be Thursday."
